Sony-PMCA-RE: select the A6KU socket backend with "-d socket".
Apply in a Sony-PMCA-RE checkout (tested on a82f5ba):
  cp <emulator>/tools/pmca-socket/socket.py pmca/usb/driver/generic/socket.py
  patch -p1 < <emulator>/tools/pmca-socket/sony-pmca-re-socket.patch
